      "writtenOn": "2021-05-13T21:35:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Are we going to expect all developers to add this to their BUILD files?\n\nYou bring up a good point; this is going to be a pain.\n\nIt\u0027s an argument to have true local includes handled better in bazel. I\u0027ve filed b/188084383 to track this, but truth be told we won\u0027t have to worry about it until users are handcrafting files. It\u0027d also be a motivation for users to change their header-handling approach ;)\n\n\u003e +1, can we do this at the macro level?\nUnfortunately not, because of selects. local_include_dirs may be arch-specific and therefore inside a select statement, and we would have to expand and modify this select within a macro, which is currently not possible.",
      "parentUuid": "bd9f8c73_e69ffc03",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 183,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 186,
        "endChar": 40
      },
